{"channelId":"UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","row":["North Clwyd Animal Rescue",2770,"This channel showcases some of our dogs, who are looking for forever homes, by showing them as we at the rescue see them. We also have videos showing some of the training and behavioural work we do with our dogs as we help them through any issues they might have. Through this work we can guide and teach these dogs thus increasing their chances of being adopted into a forever home!\nWe also put a lot of work into socialising the dogs to increase their social skills, plus it's great fun for them (and us!).\n\nNorth Clwyd Animal Rescue (NCAR) is a registered charity (No: 515195) founded in 1978 by Anne Owen and is largest animal welfare charity in the North Wales. From one thin little Lurcher, we now care for over 1500 domestic pets a year. \nWe have grown to meet these new demands and with the current economic situation these services are vital for the wider community.\n\nsupported by;\nwww.K999.com & @6csocial","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:57.047Z","channelId":"UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4af765d9d84b816b354bccbe15e614606d8836521c6a1a6a815b38255ebdf25a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"6b4748d7c815a064ba74ff199a61dbdba4e0fc156284121dba921f656efa4e18"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:57.047Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2770,"raw":"2.77K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6PSKZWl-B660cpMtD1y2vQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:57.047Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"